<title>UK: Siemens unit sets 100 mln stg Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Siemens unit sets 100 mln stg Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIEMENS CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    24.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1475  PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.96     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ   ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT GILT DUE AUGUST 1999.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
